{
  "tema": 6468,
  "slug": "debia-imperfecto-deber",
  "titulo": "Deber in the imperfect",
  "subtitulo": "Debía llegar a las ocho.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Deber is regular in the imperfect: debía, debías, debía, debíamos, debían. Debía + infinitive = was supposed to / had to; debía + noun = owed.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Deber** is a regular **-er** verb: stem **deb-** + **-ía** endings. Every form has an accent on the **í**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Deber"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "debía"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "debías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "debía"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "debíamos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "debían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Debía** + infinitive: _was supposed to_, _had to_. It often means the plan didn't happen, or a rule that applied for a while."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "debía",
            "+",
            "infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "No **a** before the infinitive: **debía estudiar**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With a noun, **deber** means _to owe_: **me debía dinero** = _he owed me money_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Yo** and **él / ella / usted** share the same form: **debía**. Add the subject if it's unclear."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Debía== llegar a las ocho, pero había mucho tráfico en la línea.",
              "en": "I was supposed to arrive at eight, but there was a lot of traffic at the border."
            },
            {
              "es": "De niño ==debía== hacer la tarea antes de salir a jugar.",
              "en": "As a kid I had to do my homework before going out to play."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿No ==debías== estar en el trabajo?",
              "en": "Weren't you supposed to be at work?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi primo me ==debía== quinientos pesos.",
              "en": "My cousin owed me five hundred pesos."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Debíamos== regar el huerto cada tarde.",
              "en": "We had to water the garden every afternoon."
            },
            {
              "es": "En esa escuela los alumnos ==debían== llevar uniforme.",
              "en": "At that school the students had to wear a uniform."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==debían== avisarme antes.",
              "en": "You all were supposed to tell me beforehand."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
